{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）表示，當地時間周日（11月1日）一架載有9人的小型飛機在佛羅里達州附近的民居墜毁，當局證實機上所有人全部罹難。</p><p>美國交通部長Sean Duffy在社交平台發文指出，飛機於周日下午約12時50分墜毁，形容是一場可怕的悲劇。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:55.825390+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:32:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T21:58:41.953290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:58:06.706304+00:00","content_hash":"13c73590d817479053100983bc13b094c15d88a869edc743dda3092c1f1b9823","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}